<title>UK: TNCC sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond.</title>
<headline>TNCC sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Europeen/BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    08.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE  L7/8.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
